flowchart TB
    Registry[工作台 Registry<br/>版本 · 摘要 · 模板绑定 · 租户启用]
    Video[视频工作台<br/>镜头与候选画布]
    Article[文章工作台<br/>目录与正文编辑]
    Commerce[电商工作台<br/>商品事实与渠道变体]
    Novel[连载小说工作台<br/>Canon · 卷章 · 连续性]
    Actions[Customer BFF + Action Contract<br/>权限 · 租户 · 幂等 · 安全投影]
    App[应用编排层<br/>命令 · 查询 · 跨域协调 · 审计]
    Facts[统一业务事实层<br/>Identity · Workspace · Source · Knowledge · Catalog · WorkTask]
    Control[流程治理层<br/>SOP · Gate · Review · Capability]
    Runtime[执行层<br/>JobRun · NodeRun · Attempt · Effect · Provider · Worker · Agent]
    Outputs[产物闭环层<br/>SubmissionRevision · ApprovedSnapshot · Artifact · DeliveryPackage]
    Learning[效果与学习<br/>PerformanceObservation · RatingDecision]
    Storage[(持久化与队列<br/>PostgreSQL · Blob · Queue)]

    Registry --> Video
    Registry --> Article
    Registry --> Commerce
    Registry --> Novel
    Video --> Actions
    Article --> Actions
    Commerce --> Actions
    Novel --> Actions
    Actions --> App
    App --> Facts
    App --> Control
    Control --> Runtime
    Runtime --> Outputs
    Facts --> Outputs
    Outputs --> Learning
    Learning -. 下一任务候选 .-> App
    Facts --> Storage
    Runtime --> Storage
    Outputs --> Storage
